#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:694
msgid "Frame rate"
msgstr "⟦Fràmé ràté~~~~⟧"

#. Settings > Graphics: a row that opens the frame rate's settings (120 Hz output, frame pacing, frame generation)
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:694
msgid "120 Hz output, frame pacing and frame generation."
msgstr "⟦120 Hz öûtpût, fràmé pàçîñg àñd fràmé géñéràtîöñ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:695
msgid "Refresh rate, frame pacing and frame generation. Press Triangle on each for more."
msgstr "⟦Réfrésh ràté, fràmé pàçîñg àñd fràmé géñéràtîöñ. Préss Trîàñglé öñ éàçh för möré.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:696
msgid "120 Hz output"
msgstr "⟦120 Hz öûtpût~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:696
msgid "For displays that take 120 Hz."
msgstr "⟦För dîsplàÿs thàt tàké 120 Hz.~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:697
msgid "Uses 120 Hz on displays that support it. Games run at normal speed, and late frames wait less."
msgstr "⟦Üsés 120 Hz öñ dîsplàÿs thàt sûppört ît. Gàmés rûñ àt ñörmàl spééd, àñd làté fràmés wàît léss.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:702
msgid "Holds a game to an even frame rate."
msgstr "⟦Hölds à gàmé tö àñ évéñ fràmé ràté.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:703
msgid "Keeps each frame on screen for the same time, so a game that can't hold full speed runs evenly: 60 or 40 fps with 120 Hz output, 30 or 20 without. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "⟦Kééps éàçh fràmé öñ sçrééñ för thé sàmé tîmé, sö à gàmé thàt çàñ't höld fûll spééd rûñs évéñlÿ: 60 ör 40 fps wîth 120 Hz öûtpût, 30 ör 20 wîthöût. Ålsö îñ thé îñ-gàmé méñû.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:706 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:763 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:835
msgid "Shows 30 fps games at 60."
msgstr "⟦Shöws 30 fps gàmés àt 60.~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:707 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:764
msgid "Adds a frame between each pair, so a 30 fps game shows at 60 (or 60 at 120 with 120 Hz output). Adds a little delay. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "⟦Ådds à fràmé bétwééñ éàçh pàîr, sö à 30 fps gàmé shöws àt 60 (ör 60 àt 120 wîth 120 Hz öûtpût). Ådds à lîttlé délàÿ. Ålsö îñ thé îñ-gàmé méñû.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:711
msgid "Your ReShade preset and effects, from {0}."
msgstr "⟦Yöûr RéShàdé prését àñd éfféçts, fröm ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~{0}.⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:712
msgid "Runs a ReShade preset made on a PC over the game. Put ReShadePreset.ini (or presets/<title ID>.ini for one game) and its Shaders and Textures folders in {0}. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "⟦Rûñs à RéShàdé prését màdé öñ à PÇ övér thé gàmé. Pût RéShàdéPrését.îñî (ör préséts/<tîtlé ÎD>.îñî för öñé gàmé) àñd îts Shàdérs àñd Téxtûrés földérs îñ ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~{0}. Ålsö îñ thé îñ-gàmé méñû.~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:715
msgid "Frame rate, CPU and memory in a corner."
msgstr "⟦Fràmé ràté, ÇPÜ àñd mémörÿ îñ à çörñér.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:716
msgid "Shows frame rate, CPU and memory use in the top-left corner. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "⟦Shöws fràmé ràté, ÇPÜ àñd mémörÿ ûsé îñ thé töp-léft çörñér. Ålsö îñ thé îñ-gàmé méñû.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

