#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:719
msgid "How new shaders are built, and shader notices."
msgstr "⟦Höw ñéw shàdérs àré bûîlt, àñd shàdér ñötîçés.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:720
msgid "Async shader compile and shader notices. Press Triangle on each for more."
msgstr "⟦Åsÿñç shàdér çömpîlé àñd shàdér ñötîçés. Préss Trîàñglé öñ éàçh för möré.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:721 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:759 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1080
msgid "No stutter while new shaders build."
msgstr "⟦Ñö stûttér whîlé ñéw shàdérs bûîld.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:722 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:760 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1081
msgid "On: shaders build in the background, so less stutter, but some things may appear late. Off: the game waits for each shader, which stutters but draws everything right."
msgstr "⟦Öñ: shàdérs bûîld îñ thé bàçkgröûñd, sö léss stûttér, bût sömé thîñgs màÿ àppéàr làté. Öff: thé gàmé wàîts för éàçh shàdér, whîçh stûttérs bût dràws évérÿthîñg rîght.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:724
msgid "Shows a notice while shaders build."
msgstr "⟦Shöws à ñötîçé whîlé shàdérs bûîld.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:725
msgid "A notice in the corner while a game builds shaders. Off hides it; shaders are built either way. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "⟦Å ñötîçé îñ thé çörñér whîlé à gàmé bûîlds shàdérs. Öff hîdés ît; shàdérs àré bûîlt éîthér wàÿ. Ålsö îñ thé îñ-gàmé méñû.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:730 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:774
msgid "Higher is sharper but needs more power."
msgstr "⟦Hîghér îs shàrpér bût ñééds möré pöwér.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:731
msgid "How large 3D scenes are drawn before scaling to the TV. Higher is sharper but needs more power, and some games slow down more."
msgstr "⟦Höw làrgé 3D sçéñés àré dràwñ béföré sçàlîñg tö thé TV. Hîghér îs shàrpér bût ñééds möré pöwér, àñd sömé gàmés slöw döwñ möré.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#. Settings > Graphics: a row that opens the textures' settings (the texture filter, custom textures)
