#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:751
msgid "Hardware shaders"
msgstr "⟦Hàrdwàré shàdérs~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:751
msgid "Off draws 3D exactly on the CPU. Off for Pokémon by default."
msgstr "⟦Öff dràws 3D éxàçtlÿ öñ thé ÇPÜ. Öff för Pökémöñ bÿ défàûlt.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:752
msgid "On runs 3D on the PS5's GPU, the fastest way. Off runs it on the CPU: slower, but outlines and lighting are exact. Off by default for the 3DS Pokémon games, whose outlines, lighting and shadows glitch otherwise. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "⟦Öñ rûñs 3D öñ thé PS5's GPÜ, thé fàstést wàÿ. Öff rûñs ît öñ thé ÇPÜ: slöwér, bût öûtlîñés àñd lîghtîñg àré éxàçt. Öff bÿ défàûlt för thé 3DS Pökémöñ gàmés, whösé öûtlîñés, lîghtîñg àñd shàdöws glîtçh öthérwîsé. Åpplîés tö thé ñéxt gàmé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:754
msgid "Outline fix"
msgstr "⟦Öûtlîñé fîx~~~~⟧"

