msgstr "⟦Fîxés mövîñg blàçk döts öñ öûtlîñéd 3D mödéls.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:755
msgid "Fixes moving black dots on outlined 3D models with hardware shaders on. For the Pokémon games, turn Hardware shaders off instead. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "⟦Fîxés mövîñg blàçk döts öñ öûtlîñéd 3D mödéls wîth hàrdwàré shàdérs öñ. För thé Pökémöñ gàmés, tûrñ Hàrdwàré shàdérs öff îñstéàd. Åpplîés tö thé ñéxt gàmé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:766
msgid "3D for red and cyan glasses"
msgstr "⟦3D för réd àñd çÿàñ glàssés~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:766
msgid "The 3DS's 3D, in red and cyan."
msgstr "⟦Thé 3DS's 3D, îñ réd àñd çÿàñ.~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:767
msgid "Shows the 3DS's 3D for red and cyan glasses, with the 3D slider all the way up. Colours change with it. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "⟦Shöws thé 3DS's 3D för réd àñd çÿàñ glàssés, wîth thé 3D slîdér àll thé wàÿ ûp. Çölöûrs çhàñgé wîth ît. Åpplîés tö thé ñéxt gàmé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:775
msgid "How large Lichii draws a game before scaling it to the TV. Higher values are sharper and use more graphics memory."
msgstr "⟦Höw làrgé Lîçhîî dràws à gàmé béföré sçàlîñg ît tö thé TV. Hîghér vàlûés àré shàrpér àñd ûsé möré gràphîçs mémörÿ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:776
msgid "How large games are drawn before scaling to the TV. 1x is 1080p docked and 720p handheld. Higher is sharper but needs more power and graphics memory. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "⟦Höw làrgé gàmés àré dràwñ béföré sçàlîñg tö thé TV. 1x îs 1080p döçkéd àñd 720p hàñdhéld. Hîghér îs shàrpér bût ñééds möré pöwér àñd gràphîçs mémörÿ. Åpplîés tö thé ñéxt gàmé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:783
msgid "Choose Bilinear, AMD FSR 1, Bicubic or Nearest neighbour. Applies when the next game starts."
msgstr "⟦Çhöösé Bîlîñéàr, ÅMD FSR 1, Bîçûbîç ör Ñéàrést ñéîghböûr. Åpplîés whéñ thé ñéxt gàmé stàrts.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:784
msgid "Bilinear is soft, Bicubic sharper, Nearest neighbour keeps pixels square. AMD FSR 1 keeps edges clean for games below 4K, at a small GPU cost."
msgstr "⟦Bîlîñéàr îs söft, Bîçûbîç shàrpér, Ñéàrést ñéîghböûr kééps pîxéls sqûàré. ÅMD FSR 1 kééps édgés çléàñ för gàmés bélöw 4K, àt à smàll GPÜ çöst.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#. Settings > Graphics on the Switch side: a row that opens FSR sharpening, anti-aliasing and Eden's ReShade looks
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:792
msgid "Picture effects"
msgstr "⟦Pîçtûré éfféçts~~~~~~⟧"

#. Settings > Graphics on the Switch side: a row that opens FSR sharpening, anti-aliasing and Eden's ReShade looks
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:792
msgid "Sharpening, anti-aliasing and ReShade."
msgstr "⟦Shàrpéñîñg, àñtî-àlîàsîñg àñd RéShàdé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

