#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:805
msgid "Smooths the jagged edges of the picture."
msgstr "⟦Smööths thé jàggéd édgés öf thé pîçtûré.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:806
msgid "FXAA smooths edges lightly, SMAA more cleanly, each at a small GPU cost. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "⟦FXÅÅ smööths édgés lîghtlÿ, SMÅÅ möré çléàñlÿ, éàçh àt à smàll GPÜ çöst. Ålsö îñ thé îñ-gàmé méñû.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:810
msgid "ASTC textures"
msgstr "⟦ÅSTÇ téxtûrés~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:810
msgid "Compressed"
msgstr "⟦Çömprésséd~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:810
msgid "Full quality"
msgstr "⟦Fûll qûàlîtÿ~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:811
msgid "Compressed saves graphics memory; full quality looks best."
msgstr "⟦Çömprésséd sàvés gràphîçs mémörÿ; fûll qûàlîtÿ lööks bést.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:812
msgid "Many Switch games use ASTC textures, which must be converted for the PS5. Compressed saves memory; Full quality uses four times as much, for games whose textures look blocky. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "⟦Màñÿ Swîtçh gàmés ûsé ÅSTÇ téxtûrés, whîçh mûst bé çöñvértéd för thé PS5. Çömprésséd sàvés mémörÿ; Fûll qûàlîtÿ ûsés föûr tîmés às mûçh, för gàmés whösé téxtûrés löök blöçkÿ. Åpplîés tö thé ñéxt gàmé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

#. Settings > Graphics: a row that opens the output resolution, refresh rate and frame generation
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:822
