msgid "Turns both screens a quarter turn at a time, for games played with the DS held sideways. The touchpad follows the turned screen. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "⟦Tûrñs böth sçrééñs à qûàrtér tûrñ àt à tîmé, för gàmés plàÿéd wîth thé DS héld sîdéwàÿs. Thé töûçhpàd föllöws thé tûrñéd sçrééñ. Ålsö îñ thé îñ-gàmé méñû.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

